{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18391","headline":"赋得春风扇微和 · 郭遵","name":"赋得春风扇微和","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微风飘淑气，散漫及兹晨。\n习习何处至，熙熙与春亲。\n暧空看早辨，映日度逾频。\n高拂非烟杂，低垂衆卉新。\n霁天轻有霭，绮陌尽无尘。\n还似登台意，元和欲煦人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭遵","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18391.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18391","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}